    "text": "If the angle made by the tangent at the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;on the curve <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>cos</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>, with the positive <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>-axis is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is equal to",
